Changes made: entries regrouped by written form into three-letter shards; obsolete and archaic senses and
senses that repeat an existing definition removed; examples limited to two; each word and definition
assigned a DNA-16 anchor and a Symbol256 meaning signature. These Wiktionary-derived files are shared under
